  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.9.0 - Analyzer Accuracy & Contradiction Fixes\n\n            🛡️ Data Integrity Improvements:\n            - AM004: Improved ctor-param and direction-aware ConstructUsing/ConvertUsing detection\n            - AM005: Added forward and reverse-map case mismatch analysis with direction-aware suppressions\n            - AM006 + AM011: Removed contradictory duplicate diagnostics for required destination properties\n            - AM011: Treats ForCtorParam as valid required-property mapping and suppresses custom construction false positives\n\n            🔧 Code Fixer Reliability:\n            - AM004 fixer bulk logic now matches analyzer behavior\n            - AM005 fixer now binds actions to the correct diagnostic instance\n            - AM011 fixer now type-checks fuzzy matches and aligns source-member collection\n\n            ✅ Validation:\n            - Added AM005 code-fix integration coverage and expanded AM004/AM005/AM006/AM011 regressions\n            - All 445 tests passing locally (433 passed, 12 skipped)\n\n            Previous Release: v2.8.0 - Architecture Refactoring & Enhanced Bulk Fixes",
